sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Caller
    participant TW as Twilio Voice
    participant TAC as TAC Routes
    participant TR as Flex TaskRouter
    participant COClient as CO REST API
    participant CR as ConversationRelay
    participant WS as TAC WebSocket
    participant HM as handleMessage
    participant LLM as Claude
    participant T as Tools (create_new_client_request,<br/>send_lead_email, end_call)

    Note over C,TR: Continued from NEW_LEAD handoff — <Enqueue> is playing to caller

    TW->>TAC: POST /waitUrl<br/>(profileId in query)
    TAC-->>TW: <Play>hold music</Play>+<Redirect>/redirect-back-to-agent
    Note over TR: TaskRouter attempts reservation.<br/>If no agent picks up in configured window,<br/>waitUrl loops or expires.
    TW-->>C: Hold music plays

    Note over TW,TAC: TaskRouter times out (no reservation).<br/>Wait URL redirects.
    TW->>TAC: POST /redirect-back-to-agent<br/>(profileId in query)
    Note over TAC: Prefetch caller traits from Memory<br/>(bypasses inflight-ingestion lag)

    Note over TAC,COClient: Delete stale CO conversation.<br/>Orchestrator sees exactly-1 rule.
    TAC->>COClient: listConversations(channelId=CallSid)
    COClient-->>TAC: [{ id: convOld }]
    TAC->>COClient: DELETE /v2/Conversations/convOld
    COClient-->>TAC: 204 No Content

    Note over TAC: Build new ConversationRelay TwiML<br/>with <Parameter takeback=true>,<br/>traits, welcomeGreeting (takeback text)
    TAC->>TW: PUT /Calls/{CallSid} { twiml: <Connect><ConversationRelay/> }
    TW->>CR: Old CR session ends, new one starts
    CR->>WS: setup event<br/>customParameters={takeback:'true', traits:..., welcomeGreeting:...}
    Note over WS: New conversationId, fresh session.<br/>onSetup caches CallSid, params, preloaded traits.
    CR-->>C: Plays takeback greeting ("agent unavailable, ask a few more...")

    C->>CR: "Yeah, sure"
    CR->>WS: prompt event
    WS->>HM: onMessageReady

    Note over HM: takeback=='true' branch:<br/>skip INTENT_DETECTION,<br/>set intent=STACK_CALL directly.<br/>Load memory + promote preloaded traits.

    HM->>LLM: STACK_CALL prompt<br/>tools=[create_new_client_request,<br/>end_call, send_lead_email]

    loop STEP 2 (2a-2f) — collect callback fields
        Note over C,LLM: rooms → adults → children → twin rooms → email → notes
        C->>CR: Answers
        CR->>WS: prompt event
        WS->>HM: onMessageReady
        HM->>LLM: full history
        LLM-->>HM: next question text
        HM-->>CR: sendResponse
    end

    Note over C,T: Caller answers final "additional notes" question

    C->>CR: "make sure we have a spot with lots of hiking"
    CR->>WS: prompt event
    WS->>HM: onMessageReady
    HM->>LLM: history now includes notes answer
    Note over LLM: STEP 3 — fire create_new_client_request<br/>alongside text acknowledgement
    LLM-->>HM: text "Okay, one moment while I log that."<br/>+ tool_use(create_new_client_request, {Notes: "hiking..."})
    HM->>T: executeTool(create_new_client_request)
    T-->>HM: "client_request_created"

    HM->>LLM: continue with tool_result
    Note over LLM: STEP 4 — fire send_lead_email (silent turn)
    LLM-->>HM: tool_use(send_lead_email, {...})
    HM->>T: executeTool(send_lead_email)
    T-->>HM: "lead_email_processed"

    HM->>LLM: continue with tool_result
    Note over LLM: STEP 5 — speak the confirmation
    LLM-->>HM: text "Great, I've created the callback<br/>and captured the note about hiking.<br/>Anything else?"
    HM-->>CR: sendResponse
    CR-->>C: TTS plays

    C->>CR: "no thanks"
    CR->>WS: prompt event
    WS->>HM: onMessageReady
    HM->>LLM: with "no" answer
    Note over LLM: STEP 6 — farewell + end_call
    LLM-->>HM: text farewell + tool_use(end_call)
    HM->>T: executeTool(end_call)
    Note over T: Sets session.pendingHandoffData,<br/>disables watchdog
    T-->>HM: "end_call_initiated"

    HM-->>CR: sendResponse(farewell)
    Note over CR: TAC sends WebSocket "end" frame<br/>after TTS finishes
    CR-->>C: Plays farewell TTS
    CR->>TAC: POST /enqueue-or-end-call with HandoffData(endCall:true)
    TAC-->>TW: empty TwiML → call hangs up
    TAC->>TAC: finalizeConversation<br/>(CO CLOSE + clearConversationById)
